who spends the entire hour
roasting people in the crowd

00:09:37.968 --> 00:09:40.367
and you laugh and laugh,
until he points at you and says,

00:09:40.367 --> 00:09:41.934
"Hey, check out this idiot.

00:09:41.934 --> 00:09:44.234
Looks like he stuck his face
in the testicle tanner,"

00:09:44.234 --> 00:09:46.467
[ Laughter ]
and then you're like,
"Whoa, whoa!

00:09:46.467 --> 00:09:48.334
That's not fair.
It's called red light therapy.

00:09:48.334 --> 00:09:50.968
I heard about it on the news!"
[ Laughter ]

00:09:50.968 --> 00:09:53.234
But Fox News was apparently
prepared for the possibility

00:09:53.234 --> 00:09:55.267
that they might, one day,
have to part ways with Tucker

00:09:55.267 --> 00:09:57.501
because yesterday,
Rolling Stone reported

00:09:57.501 --> 00:09:59.133
this truly insane story...

00:10:15.267 --> 00:10:16.067
Fox reportedly...

00:10:27.701 --> 00:10:31.133
Holy [bleep], his own employer
was collecting dirt on him.

00:10:31.133 --> 00:10:34.067
[ Laughter ]
I mean, I can't imagine
if NBC ever did that to me.

00:10:34.067 --> 00:10:35.434
"Hey, Meyers,
you better watch out.

00:10:35.434 --> 00:10:37.167
We got a picture of you
in a chicken suit

00:10:37.167 --> 00:10:38.901
next to Donald Trump

00:10:38.901 --> 00:10:40.567
and we're going to send it
to Page Six."

00:10:40.567 --> 00:10:42.767
Well, too bad, fellas.
That was already on TV.

00:10:42.767 --> 00:10:44.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:44.534 --> 00:10:48.067
[ Cheering ]
Simpler times, you guys.

00:10:48.067 --> 00:10:49.467
Simpler times.

00:10:49.467 --> 00:10:51.868
Tell you this, though --

00:10:51.868 --> 00:10:53.968
if I ever find the guy
who wrote that sketch --

00:10:53.968 --> 00:10:54.968
It was me?!

00:10:54.968 --> 00:10:56.501
[ Laughter ]

00:10:56.501 --> 00:10:59.901
Also, if you're an employer
collecting dirt on an employee,

00:10:59.901 --> 00:11:01.868
but you're not doing
anything about it,

00:11:01.868 --> 00:11:03.667
unless you need it for revenge,

00:11:03.667 --> 00:11:06.200
that speaks badly of them
and of you.

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:08.701
That's not how HR
is supposed to work.

00:11:08.701 --> 00:11:11.100
[ Laughter ]
When we did our HR training here
at "Late Night,"

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.234
I don't remember anyone saying,
"And just remember,

00:11:13.234 --> 00:11:15.701
we'll be keeping a blackmail
file on all of you."

00:11:15.701 --> 00:11:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:11:16.834 --> 00:11:19.033
This is the state
of the MAGA movement.

00:11:19.033 --> 00:11:20.334
It's an abject failure

00:11:20.334 --> 00:11:21.934
and now, they're all
devouring each other.

00:11:21.934 --> 00:11:23.267
They were
at each other's throats

00:11:23.267 --> 00:11:26.601
after losing in 2018, 2020,
and 2022;

00:11:26.601 --> 00:11:28.601
they're bickering and fighting
with each other in Congress;

00:11:28.601 --> 00:11:30.834
and now, their leading
propaganda network

00:11:30.834 --> 00:11:33.501
is navigating a messy split
from their former leading host.

00:11:33.501 --> 00:11:34.701
After all these years,

00:11:34.701 --> 00:11:36.734
I think we deserve
to just sit back

00:11:36.734 --> 00:11:38.734
and watch these people
kick each other in the...

00:11:38.734 --> 00:11:39.667
-Testicle.

00:11:39.667 --> 00:11:40.868
[ Laughter and applause ]
-This

00:11:40.868 --> 00:11:41.968
has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:41.968 --> 00:11:45.634
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

